{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんたーん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は撮影でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ内容は内緒だけど5thへの\n動きも始まっているので\nぜひ楽しみにしていてね( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/01/30/5061717/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てみて( •ㅈ• )\n手のりまあやと美雲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か可愛いの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、まあやの呼び方なんだけど\n矢印で記号付けてってたくさんの方に\n言われたので...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"呼び方はこんな感じ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま↑あ↑や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部上にひっぱる感じで\nそしてファンタジーとかで\n意地悪なおばあさんが\n呼びつけるみたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかったかな？\nこれはねーぜひ握手会で\n1回呼んでみてね( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/01/30/5061717/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車の椅子に座れてらっきー\nを感じるあたし。\n小さいラッキー見つけた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}